                        <p>It started with curiosity: changing CSS to see what broke, breaking JavaScript to see why, then rebuilding it properly. It turned into shipping real software — browser games running custom Three.js engines, offline-capable apps people install on their phones, and an assistant wired into Gemini.</p>
                        <p>Everything here is built in the open. If something looks useful, the source is on GitHub.</p>
